{"availability":"available","full":"koul777/HRMCP","name":"HRMCP","description":"HRMCP — NCS 기반 HR MCP 서버: 공고문 기반 직무기술서 작성 · NCS 검색 · 교육훈련 추천 (ChatGPT·Claude에 HTTPS 한 줄로 연결)","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":9,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-05T06:50:47Z","updated":"2026-10-05T14:12:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ncs-mcp-bridge-mini2.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ncs-mcp-bridge-mini2.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:17.678Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:17.678Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:17.678Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:32.978Z","stars":9,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:33:17.678Z","stars":9,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["운영 원칙(2026-09-11): production DB/API 갱신, 온톨로지 재구축, 경량 패키지 생성, Vercel 반영, 기준본 승격은 Windows NCS Data Builder (runncsbuilder.bat) 한 경로로만 수행합니다. GitHub Actions는 CI 검증만 수행하며, 별도 snapshot refresh/deploy workflow와 self-hosted runner는 운영하지 않습니다. 자격/NCS006 수집만 기존 운영자 승인·재시도 가드를 따르는 별도 예외이며 자동 Builder 단계가 아닙니다.","HR 실무에서 NCS를 활용하는 가장 빠른 길. 채용 직무에 맞는 NCS 분류부터 능력단위 → 능력단위요소 → 수행준거 → 지식(K)·기술(S)·태도(A)까지, 사람이 일일이 찾아 정리하던 정보를 이제 AI가 구조화된 NCS 데이터베이스에서 직접 조회해 활용합니다."],"features":["Added a source-backed hierarchy gate for every explicit job scope. Exact and unique NCS paths are promoted to a hard containment filter; unresolved, fuzzy, cross-major, cross-type, and Unicode-equivalent collisions fail…","Applied the same rule to task-transition recommendations so partial job labels can never fall through to a historical LIKE ... LIMIT 1 choice.","Added all-major execution-gate and collision-audit scripts. The latest gate covers 24/24 majors, 96 hierarchy samples, and 288 calls with zero unexpected results and no holdout inspection or database mutation.","Hardened scope resolution against homographs: exact official competency-unit titles now bind to their complete source path, while one-sided prefixes (for example 인사하기 → 인사) are not promoted to a classification. A…","Added Builder safeguards for code-only releases: a missing deployed-version pointer is rejected, and the operation is journaled as copycurrent with restart-safe version persistence. Superseded Builder versions are…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koul777/HRMCP/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8548b651f00af47a57a8c9d656f4be1a5d6a5703586998179b2965fab5546a36","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.161Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.161Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"운영 원칙(2026-09-11): production DB/API 갱신, 온톨로지 재구축, 경량 패키지 생성, Vercel 반영, 기준본 승격은 Windows NCS Data Builder (runncsbuilder.bat) 한 경로로만 수행합니다. GitHub Actions는 CI 검증만 수행하며, 별도 snapshot refresh/deploy workflow와 self-hosted runner는 운영하지 않습니다. 자격/NCS006 수집만 기존 운영자 승인·재시도 가드를 따르는 별도 예외이며 자동 Builder 단계가 아닙니다.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koul777/HRMCP/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"GitHub Actions는 CI > 검증만 수행하며, 별도 snapshot refresh/deploy workflow와 self-hosted > runner는 운영하지 않습니다. 자격/NCS006 수집만 기존 운영자 승인·재시도 > 가드를 따르는 별도 예외이며 자동 Builder 단계가 아닙니다.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koul777/HRMCP/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8548b651f00af47a57a8c9d656f4be1a5d6a5703586998179b2965fab5546a36","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koul777/HRMCP/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.163Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T14:12:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koul777/HRMCP/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.169Z","hash":"8548b651f00af47a57a8c9d656f4be1a5d6a5703586998179b2965fab5546a36","originalBytes":83189,"storedBytes":83189,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ncs","ksa","mcp","api","hrmcp","vercel","builder","hit","docs","holdout","claude","bytes","setup","images","snapshot","alias","production","url","sqlite","compact","mrr","jpg","chatgpt","job","